{"study_accession":"PRJNA459725","secondary_study_accession":"SRP144588","title":"Targeted sequencing based maternal whole blood expression changes with gestational age and labor in normal pregnancy","description":"Maternal plasama colected longitudinally were profiled using targeted sequencing (DriverMap™) (https://www.cellecta.com) to evaluate changes with gestational age and with labor in normal pregnancy. Overall design: The study included normal pregnancies with (TIL) (n=8) and without (TNL) (n=8) spontaneous labor at term. Half of the women in each group had 3 longitudinal samples taken from 12.1-40.3 weeks of gestation, while the other half of women had only one sample taken at term before delivery, for a total of 32 samples. Note that Sample_26 was considered contaminated and hence data for that sample was not included in downstream analyses.","pubmed":"30696862;31829938;34195686","geo_series":"","n_samples":32,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN09069632","study_accession":"PRJNA459725","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample_9 [RNA-Seq 2]","description":"Sample_9 [RNA-Seq 2]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM3131181","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":3,"first_public":"2019-02-09","attributes":[["source_name","Maternal Blood"],["individual","mi058"],["group","TIL"],["gestational age","39.3"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR7119234","experiment_accession":"SRX4040885","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":4148732,"base_count":323601096,"first_public":"2019-02-09","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3131181: Sample_9 [RNA-Seq 2] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR7119235","experiment_accession":"SRX4040885","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":4949461,"base_count":386057958,"first_public":"2019-02-09","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3131181: Sample_9 [RNA-Seq 2] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},